pan><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算被单方面告知时间已到</span></p><p begin="00:18.703" end="00:20.639" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:18.703" end="00:19.307">何が</span><span begin="00:19.307" end="00:19.780">愛か</span><span begin="00:19.780" end="00:20.078">知ら</span><span begin="00:20.078" end="00:20.405">な</span><span begin="00:20.405" end="00:20.639">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也在粉饰着丑陋的日子</span></p><p begin="00:20.650" end="00:23.300" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:20.650" end="00:21.081">だから</span><span begin="00:21.081" end="00:21.585">二人で</span><span begin="00:21.585" end="00:22.076">愛を</span><span begin="00:22.076" end="00:22.668">作ったん</span><span begin="00:22.668" end="00:23.300">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仍极力粉饰着那些丑陋的时光</span></p><p begin="00:23.308" end="00:25.213" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:23.308" end="00:23.819">これで</span><span begin="00:23.819" end="00:24.436">いいのか</span><span begin="00:24.436" end="00:25.213">なんて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在归咎于时间之前——</span></p><p begin="00:25.224" end="00:27.572" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:25.224" end="00:25.879">私に</span><span begin="00:25.879" end="00:26.431">聞かない</span><span begin="00:26.431" end="00:26.699">で</span><span begin="00:26.699" end="00:27.572">よね</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在把一切归咎于时间之前</span></p><p begin="00:27.583" end="00:29.598" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:27.583" end="00:27.913">Yeah,</span> <span begin="00:27.913" end="00:28.032">we</span> <span begin="00:28.032" end="00:28.434">are</span> <span begin="00:28.434" end="00:29.012">always</span> <span begin="00:29.012" end="00:29.598">high</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">燃烧吧</span></p><p begin="00:30.109" end="00:31.999" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:30.109" end="00:30.741">惹かれ</span><span begin="00:30.741" end="00:31.256">あって</span><span begin="00:31.256" end="00:31.999">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">由你来燃亮起火焰吧</span></p><p begin="00:32.421" end="00:34.083" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:32.421" end="00:33.051">あなたが</span><span begin="00:33.051" end="00:33.615">ピーター</span><span begin="00:33.615" end="00:34.083">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">去成为点亮你的火焰</span></p><p begin="00:34.093" end="00:36.573" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:34.093" end="00:34.681">私が</span><span begin="00:34.681" end="00:35.267">ウェンディを</span><span begin="00:35.267" end="00:35.770">演じ</span><span begin="00:35.770" end="00:36.573">た</span></p><p begin="00:36.915" end="00:41.452" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:36.915" end="00:38.408">そばに</span><span begin="00:38.408" end="00:38.955">いる</span><span begin="00:38.955" end="00:40.104">事にも</span><span begin="00:40.104" end="00:40.424">慣</span><span begin="00:40.424" end="00:41.452">れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我 便是那花火</span></p><p begin="00:41.459" end="00:45.809" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:41.459" end="00:42.114">い</span><span begin="00:42.114" end="00:42.695">な</span><span begin="00:42.695" end="00:43.044">い</span><span begin="00:43.044" end="00:44.113">事にも</span><span begin="00:44.113" end="00:45.010">慣れて</span><span begin="00:45.010" end="00:45.809">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">化作空中的火</span></p><p begin="00:45.816" end="00:48.360" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:45.816" end="00:46.199">ねえ</span><span begin="00:46.199" end="00:46.648">君が</span><span begin="00:46.648" end="00:47.270">好きって</span> <span begin="00:47.270" end="00:47.547">Again</span> <span begin="00:47.547" end="00:47.713">and</span> <span begin="00:47.713" end="00:48.360">again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我 是只存在一刹那的花火</span></p><p begin="00:48.370" end="00:50.624" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:48.370" end="00:48.769">また</span><span begin="00:48.769" end="00:49.043">離</span><span begin="00:49.043" end="00:49.471">れ</span><span begin="00:49.471" end="00:49.629">て</span> <span begin="00:49.629" end="00:49.975">Again</span> <span begin="00:49.975" end="00:50.114">and</span> <span begin="00:50.114" end="00:50.624">again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">存在并不漫长</span></p><p begin="00:50.631" end="00:52.936" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:50.631" end="00:51.109">また</span><span begin="00:51.109" end="00:51.257">戻</span><span begin="00:51.257" end="00:51.533">る</span><span begin="00:51.533" end="00:51.736">の</span> <span begin="00:51.736" end="00:51.972">Again</span> <span begin="00:51.972" end="00:52.404">and</span> <span begin="00:52.404" end="00:52.936">again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知你是否还会想起那青涩的夜晚</span></p><p begin="00:54.676" end="00:59.272" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:54.676" end="00:55.059">狂</span><span begin="00:55.059" end="00:55.766">わせた</span><span begin="00:55.766" end="00:56.925">時計と</span><span begin="00:56.925" end="00:57.632">壊れた</span><span begin="00:57.632" end="00:58.101">コン</span><span begin="00:58.101" end="00:58.357">パ</span><span begin="00:58.357" end="00:58.882">ス</span><span begin="00:58.882" end="00:59.272">が</span></p><p begin="00:59.280" end="01:03.840" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:59.280" end="01:00.226">私たち</span><span begin="01:00.772" end="01:01.255">を</span><span begin="01:01.255" end="01:02.421">大人に</span><span begin="01:02.421" end="01:02.909">させ</span><span begin="01:02.909" end="01:03.840">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们说爱只是一场游戏</span></p><p begin="01:03.852" end="01:08.427" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="01:03.852" end="01:04.204">繰り</span><span begin="01:04.204" end="01:04.894">返し</span><span begin="01:04.962" end="01:05.951">てる</span><span begin="01:06.156" end="01:06.758">最後の</span><span begin="01:06.758" end="01:07.477">キス</span> <span begin="01:07.624" end="01:08.427">ああ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道火焰终将燃尽湮熄</span></p><p begin="01:08.438" end="01:10.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="01:08.438" end="01:08.807">まだ</span><span begin="01:08.807" end="01:09.446">ここに</span><span begin="01:09.446" end="01:10.400">いる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即便一切已被岁月尘封</span></p><p begin="01:10.411" end="01:13.221" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="01:10.411" end="01:10.739">We</span> <span begin="01:10.739" end="01:11.292">never,</span> <span begin="01:11.292" end="01:11.842">never</span> <span begin="01:11.842" end="01:12.446">grow</span> <span begin="01:12.446" end="01:13.221">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否也会感怀昔日美好</span></p><p begin="01:13.565" end="01:15.851" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="01:13.565" end="01:13.819">We</span> <span begin="01:13.819" end="01:14.129">are</span> <span begin="01:14.129" end="01:14.662">never,</span> <span begin="01:14.662" end="01:15.333">never</span> <span begin="01:15.333" end="01:15.539">grow</span> <span begin="01:15.539" end="01:15.851">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像那一天的夜晚一样</span></p><p begin="01:15.862" end="01:18.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="01:15.862" end="01:16.300">二人</span><span begin="01:16.300" end="01:16.874">とも</span><span begin="01:16.874" end="01:17.583">気付いては</span><span begin="01:17.583" end="01:18.150">いたけど</span></p><p begin="01:18.161" end="01:20.393" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="01:18.161" end="01:18.648">歪</span><span begin="01:18.648" end="01:18.783">み</span><span begin="01:18.783" end="01:19.338">始め</span><span begin="01:19.338" end="01:19.520">て</span><span begin="01:19.520" end="01:19.661">いた</span> <span begin="01:19.661" end="01:20.393">Love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">两人一同燃亮起火焰吧</span></p><p begin="01:20.404" end="01:22.469" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="01:20.404" end="01:20.974">君の</span><span begin="01:20.974" end="01:21.221">目を</span><span begin="01:21.221" end="01:21.513">見て</span><span begin="01:21.513" end="01:22.080">わかっちゃっ</span><span begin="01:22.080" end="01:22.469">た</span></p><p begin="01:22.479" end="01:24.643" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="01:22.479" end="01:22.726">ねえ</span><span begin="01:22.726" end="01:23.607">なんなんだよ</span><span begin="01:23.607" end="01:24.336">わかってくれ</span><span begin="01:24.336" end="01:24.643">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此刻由两人共同点亮</span></p><p begin="01:24.653" end="01:27.245" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="01:24.653" end="01:25.049">とか</span><span begin="01:25.049" end="01:25.559">決して</span><span begin="01:25.559" end="01:25.905">そんな</span><span begin="01:25.905" end="01:26.398">荒い</span><span begin="01:26.398" end="01:26.758">気持ち</span><span begin="01:26.758" end="01:27.245">じゃない</span></p><p begin="01:27.256" end="01:29.426" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="01:27.256" end="01:27.750">君の</span><span begin="01:27.750" end="01:28.416">さよならが</span><span begin="01:28.416" end="01:28.781">重い</span><span begin="01:28.781" end="01:29.198">言葉</span><span begin="01:29.198" end="01:29.426">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你便是那花火 绚烂无比</span></p><p begin="01:29.436" end="01:31.335" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="01:29.436" end="01:30.087">聞こえなく</span><span begin="01:30.087" end="01:30.635">なったん</span><span begin="01:30.635" end="01:31.335">だよ</span></p><p begin="01:31.780" end="01:36.099" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="01:31.780" end="01:32.323">こ</span><span begin="01:32.323" end="01:32.862">ん</span><span begin="01:32.862" end="01:33.322">な</span><span begin="01:33.322" end="01:33.934">事</span><span begin="01:33.934" end="01:34.902">言いたく</span><span begin="01:34.902" end="01:35.201">な</span><span begin="01:35.201" end="01:36.099">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能否陪伴在你的身旁</span></p><p begin="01:36.111" end="01:40.731" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32"><span begin="01:36.111" end="01:36.501">けど</span><span begin="01:36.501" end="01:37.483">君</span><span begin="01:37.483" end="01:38.140">しか</span><span begin="01:38.140" end="01:39.142">知らない</span><span begin="01:39.142" end="01:39.754">から</span><span begin="01:39.754" end="01:40.731">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你便是那花火 永远在我左右</span></p><p begin="01:40.966" end="01:43.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33"><span begin="01:40.966" end="01:41.852">行かないで</span><span begin="01:41.852" end="01:42.225">って</span> <span begin="01:42.225" end="01:42.356">Again</span> <span begin="01:42.356" end="01:42.530">and</span> <span begin="01:42.530" end="01:43.194">again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">任时间荏苒 始终牵挂着我</span></p><p begin="01:43.204" end="01:45.478" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34"><span begin="01:43.204" end="01:43.603">もう</span><span begin="01:43.603" end="01:44.105">消えて</span><span begin="01:44.105" end="01:44.441">って</span> <span begin="01:44.441" end="01:44.645">Again</span> <span begin="01:44.645" end="01:44.982">and</span> <span begin="01:44.982" end="01:45.478">again</span></p><p begin="01:45.486" end="01:47.781" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35"><span begin="01:45.486" end="01:46.117">愛して</span><span begin="01:46.117" end="01:46.617">るって</span> <span begin="01:46.617" end="01:47.000">Again</span> <span begin="01:47.000" end="01:47.170">and</span> <span begin="01:47.170" end="01:47.781">again</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我成为火光 熊熊燃烧</span></p><p begin="01:49.601" end="01:54.156" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36"><span begin="01:49.601" end="01:49.901">狂</span><span begin="01:49.901" end="01:50.580">わせた</span><span begin="01:50.580" end="01:51.817">時計と</span><span begin="01:51.817" end="01:52.431">壊れた</span><span begin="01:52.431" end="01:52.794">コン</span><span begin="01:52.794" end="01:53.591">パス</span><span begin="01:53.591" end="01:54.156">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在你的身旁绽放着微笑</span></p><p begin="01:54.167" end="01:58.707" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37"><span begin="01:54.167" end="01:55.104">私たち</span><span begin="01:55.642" end="01:56.221">を</span><span begin="01:56.221" end="01:57.245">大人に</span><span begin="01:57.245" end="01:57.818">させ</span><span begin="01:57.818" end="01:58.707">ない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要忘记我</span></p><p begin="01:58.715" end="02:03.263" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38"><span begin="01:58.715" end="01:59.133">繰り</span><span begin="01:59.133" end="01:59.798">返し</span><span begin="01:59.798" end="02:00.762">てる</span><span begin="02:01.001" end="02:01.604">最後の</span><span begin="02:01.604" end="02:02.181">キス</span> <span begin="02:02.181" end="02:03.263">ああ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾爱过你的那个少女</span></p><p begin="02:03.272" end="02:05.336" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39"><span begin="02:03.272" end="02:03.640">まだ</span><span begin="02:03.640" end="02:04.369">ここに</span><span begin="02:04.369" end="02:04.631">い</span><span begin="02:04.631" end="02:05.336">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会永远守候在这里</span></p><p begin="02:05.347" end="02:07.917" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40"><span begin="02:05.347" end="02:05.657">We</span> <span begin="02:05.657" end="02:06.142">never,</span> <span begin="02:06.142" end="02:06.699">never</span> <span begin="02:06.699" end="02:07.279">grow</span> <span begin="02:07.279" end="02:07.917">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哪怕有一天</span></p><p begin="02:08.426" end="02:11.768" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41"><span begin="02:08.426" end="02:08.949">Never</span> <span begin="02:08.949" en